# Percussion Freaks (GQ881 VER. EAB), Konami 1999: the first power-on, from blank NVRAM, with
# the game cassette in; no inputs. Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames,
# to compare with MAME.
game pcnfrk

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 6000 quit
